{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/M-zayFhgnN-IKpmaAPjSHQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:54.428123+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/M-zayFhgnN-IKpmaAPjSHQ","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>20</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>27</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>中央财经大学人工智能研究院关于2027年推免生（含直博生）接收</span></strong><strong><span>相关事宜的补充说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dLBesCqkPI1r2VuUC59MXSMRonWsPOHSGXG316OMSVj5Nf9rHL4L6wytCojUUlzeGNXRVwlGwk9qlWCCwCW4bRqvQJFBUjxzu9vKd9clZnE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span><span>如果你怀揣以智能科技洞见财经未来的雄心</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>如果你渴望在算法与数据的浪潮中引领发展</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>欢迎报考中央财经大学人工智能研究院研究生！</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>各位考生：</span></span></p><p><span><span>近日，中央财经大学发布了《关于开展中央财经大学接收2027年推免生（含直博生）工作的通知》。根据学校工作安排，</span><strong><span><span>报名时间延长至9月6日（周日）中午12:00</span></span></strong></span><span><span>（通知详见</span><span><span>https://gs.cufe.edu.cn/info/1028/7101.htm</span></span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>为深入贯彻落实国家教育数字化与人工智能融合发展战略部署，积极服务数字中国建设与数智经济发展对高层次、复合型、创新型人才的迫切需求，中央财经大学依托深厚的财经学科底蕴与跨学科研究优势，于2025年成立人工智能研究院，并启动招生工作。2026年，按照工作安排接收推免生（含直博生），现将相关事宜补充说明如下。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>01</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究生培养简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dLBesCqkPI0orKxyy4H2IjfdSKhvP3Slp3UpCeA3QZYpo4o5iay8QU85zIwsZ9ibZ78gc12vgA6opg0R3jhQuXHRGlkETO14YnWcMD9HFC8fg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）培养定位与目标</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>人工智能研究院坚持以服务国家重大战略需求为导向，秉持“交叉创新、创新引领、智赋未来”的培养理念，着力构建科教融合、产教协同的跨学科人才培养体系。项目汇聚校内外人工智能、计算机科学、金融学、经济学等领域著名学者，组建高水平导师团队，提供全方位、高层次的学术指导与职业引领。</span></p><p><span>同时，依托学校“金融人工智能北京市重点实验室”等省部级科研平台，聚焦交叉学科前沿研究，着力强化学生原始创新能力和关键技术攻关能力，致力于培养精通智能科技与财经管理的复合型人才。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>（二）培养特色与核心优势</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.跨校名师领航</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>聘任北京航空航天大学8位计算机领域高层次专家担任兼职博导，并聘请“国家杰出青年科学基金”获得者担任人工智能研究院首席科学家。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.科研平台赋能</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>依托学校“金融人工智能北京市重点实验室”等省部级科研平台，为学生提供接触学术前沿、参与重大项目的实践载体。推动课程学习、科研训练与产业实践深度融合，实现知识建构、能力培养与价值塑造的有机统一。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.“AI+财经”融合</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>立足学校深厚财经学科优势，创新“AI+”深度融合课程体系与培养模式，围绕金融智能、数字经济、智能管理等方向，培养能够运用人工智能核心技术破解财经领域复杂难题的复合型、战略型紧缺人才。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>02</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业和计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dLBesCqkPI2lhPzfyqOlTEiaz99wlBcRe4W7VF5jKDNjwzG72BEokQ4RUKTNX3AOnI1dK4UFqiboUglZ4aoRpeqwQdZnfbdX5k7wIYJIZtFnU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dLBesCqkPI13pKOZhiaulKN2zXQChyYpbzLM7t37kcibdx7odKZX5IH4WNPQldv6iaMPt9VIicaHyQ32FNGokoiafzLkbooWgVz2zgke010mGXl4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>03</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>工作流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dLBesCqkPI2Y2EtGO45611lpHLMEs4zBUleibZnS1hNicgP4nYKcjepn624xeAJfP8XdKOKOT6Sl06EafWkyEx6j740cIHCS2RzANXOQesW3U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>相关考核选拔流程按照《关于开展中央财经大学接收2027年推免生（含直博生）工作的通知》执行。</span></p><p><span><span>通知链接详见：</span></span></p><p><span>https://gs.cufe.edu.cn/info/1028/7101.htm</span></p><p><span><span>系统相关操作提示详见：</span></span></p><p><span>https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/iof3NTTt_wXnaRHXdeoDRQ</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2027级研究生招生计划及其他信息以学校研究生院官网发布为准。后续考核和录取具体事宜，请关注</span><span><strong><span><span>中央财经大学研究生院<span>和</span>人工智能研究院</span></span></strong></span><span>通知。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>04</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>咨询方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dLBesCqkPI37KyJdib9PebTLgxLiaicOA0iaeckpqiccn3RPichiaROnRJUzNmiaRzP4jmVB2cZKgSQpVA7Mo2ibkoHr0cagcYp6icwHTR2Tmv80XmzoE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.邮箱：</span></strong><span>cufeai@cufe.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>2.电话：</span></strong><span>010-62288500</span></p><p><span>          （工作时间）</span></p><p><strong><span>3.公众号：</span></strong></p><p><span>中央财经大学研究生院</span></p><p><span><span>中央财经大学人工智能研究院</span></span></p><p><strong><span>4.官方网站：</span></strong></p><p><span>中央财经大学研究生院：</span></p><p><span>      http://gs.cufe.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><em><span><span><br/></span></span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span><span>欢迎广大考生报考！</span></span></em></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>编辑｜中央财经大学人工智能研究院</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"368ca02098799177fb7ed55621ea2bc1a869d98c2d9b183c1d49c287a6f028d7","textLength":1297,"sourceSha256":"9443c948feaafd0c212d5f8ca26bf245f857207a475f8f362f4c1bd92773688f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b2c6de1ca0ddf9227fb8","title":"2026年中央财经大学人工智能研究院关于2027年推免生（含直博生）接收相关事宜的补充说明","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:54.428123+00:00"}
